@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber

title To Register an Appraisal Entity

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

' Human communication started by Administrator
activate Administrator

Administrator -> System : I want to register an Appraisal Entity in the system

    activate System
    System -->> Administrator : Provide the information for the New Appraisal Entity
    Administrator -> System : For the new Appraisal Entity (apEntityXPTO), here's the information
    System -->> Administrator : Appraisal Entity has been registered in the system
    deactivate System

deactivate Administrator

@enduml